{"name": "Midnight Billiards", "description": "<div class=\"game_area_description\" id=\"game_area_description\">\n<h2>About This Game</h2>\n<h2 class=\"bb_tag\">Demo is now available!\u00a0</h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video autoplay=\"\" class=\"bb_img\" height=\"658\" loop=\"\" muted=\"\" playsinline=\"\" poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3546480/extras/404f905a72a1e342291f320462846b2a.poster.avif?t=1777329120\" width=\"1170\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3546480/extras/404f905a72a1e342291f320462846b2a.webm?t=1777329120\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"/><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3546480/extras/404f905a72a1e342291f320462846b2a.mp4?t=1777329120\" type=\"video/mp4\"/></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">----------</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><strong>Midnight Billiards</strong> is a <strong>turn-based</strong> <strong>roguelite</strong> game inspired by <i>Peglin</i> and billiards. Your goal is to bounce\u00a0 the ball\u00a0strategically  across the pool, triggering various post effects along the way.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">In each game, you\u2019ll collect various items to deck-build your own unique playstyle. Spend your money in the shop to purchase items. </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">Along the way, you\u2019ll encounter all kinds of characters and mini-challenges. </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">Ultimately, you\u2019ll face the boss of the building and strive to become the King of Midnight!</p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\"><strong>Rotate and Shoot</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video autoplay=\"\" class=\"bb_img\" height=\"658\" loop=\"\" muted=\"\" playsinline=\"\" poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3546480/extras/b6069642f01a6c1974e828f8b58e807f.poster.avif?t=1777329120\" width=\"1170\"><source src=\"https